<title>UK: Britannia B/S sets 50 mln stg structured 5-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Britannia B/S sets 50 mln stg structured 5-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following structured bond was announced by sole manager UBS Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BRITANNIA BUILDING SOCIETY </p>
<p> AMT     50 MLN STG   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    01.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +20 BP    PAY DATE    01.JUL.97</p>
<p> MOODY	A2	  ISS PRICE  100.10    FULL FEES   0.10</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/GB</p>
<p> NOTES     *BORROWER OPTION AFTER FIRST YEAR TO SWITCH TO FIXED</p>
<p>		8.25 PERCENT ANNUAL COUPON.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
